@base = https://localhost:7272

### 1. Aprovação (conta 1: 1000 → 900)
POST {{base}}/v1/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: teste-021

{ "cardToken": "tok_demo_0001", "amount": 100.00, "currency": "EUR", "merchantId": "m_0001", "mcc": "5411" }

### 2. Mesma chave, mesmo corpo → deve devolver o MESMO authorizationId
POST {{base}}/v1/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: teste-001

{ "cardToken": "tok_demo_0001", "amount": 100.00, "currency": "EUR", "merchantId": "m_0001", "mcc": "5411" }

### 3. Mesma chave, corpo diferente → 422
POST {{base}}/v1/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: teste-001

{ "cardToken": "tok_demo_0001", "amount": 999.00, "currency": "EUR", "merchantId": "m_0001", "mcc": "5411" }

### 4. Cartão adicional dividindo o limite: 950 > 900 disponíveis → INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
POST {{base}}/v1/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: teste-002

{ "cardToken": "tok_demo_0002", "amount": 950.00, "currency": "EUR", "merchantId": "m_0002", "mcc": "5541" }

### 5. Cartão bloqueado → CARD_BLOCKED
POST {{base}}/v1/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: teste-003

{ "cardToken": "tok_demo_0004", "amount": 10.00, "currency": "EUR", "merchantId": "m_0003", "mcc": "5812" }

### 6. Sem Idempotency-Key → 400
POST {{base}}/v1/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardToken": "tok_demo_0001", "amount": 10.00, "currency": "EUR", "merchantId": "m_0001", "mcc": "5411" }

@sim = https://localhost:7103

### Estado atual do simulador
GET {{sim}}/admin/faults

### Rede lenta: 2 s de latência
POST {{sim}}/admin/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 2000, "errorRate": 0 }

### Rede normal
POST {{sim}}/admin/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 40, "errorRate": 0 }